Thank you for supporting "Reignman". According to feedback from players, we updated the game today and fixed some bugs.

1. New adventure badge system: reward certificate with repeated customs clearance, with certain attribute bonus;
2, the new vocational skills system: including 4 professional with different skill systems, extending more interesting gameplay;
3, new beginner guidance system: for novice users to explain, a smoother start-up game;
4. Optimize the event triggering experience: enhance the reward experience after the event is triggered;
5. Strengthen the experience and balance of major occupations;
6, fix some known bugs and feature experience optimization;

Thank you for your valuable comments, we will continue to optimize the game in future versions.

Thank you for supporting the "Reignman". According to recent suggestions on the game, we have optimized and updated the game. The details are as follows:

1. Dead heroes retain adjust attribute when resurrected;
2. Cut down the number of layers in each chapter;
3. Merge non-battle events;
4. Max Lv. of the heroes now extend to 4;
5. Heroes without combat will heal 20% max HP after the battle;
6. Fix some known bugs;
7. Adjust the level data;
8. Player can have another chance to challenge when he lose a battle;

Thank you for your valuable comments, we will continue to optimize the game in future versions
